43:["$","h3","h3-4",{"id":"is-there-a-metro-to-recc-in-malham","children":"Is there a metro to RECC in Malham?"}]
44:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"No. RECC is remote with no metro, so plan to go by car."}]
45:["$","h3","h3-5",{"id":"which-venue-is-closest-to-the-airport","children":"Which venue is closest to the airport?"}]
46:["$","p","p-9",{"children":"RFECC, at ROSHN Front, is near King Khalid International Airport. RICEC is about 30 minutes from RUH."}]
